<title>CHINA: Trading in Yaohan Int'l shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Yaohan Int'l shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said trading in shares of Yaohan International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Tuesday afternoon at its direction pending an announcement.  </p>
<p>The stock rose sharply on Tuesday morning to HK$0.75, up HK$0.11, or 17 percent, before trading was suspended.</p>
<p>Yaohan operates department stores and retails consumer products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
